id: pm-vcs-phase6gc
title: "Collect unreachable objects without losing oplog, lease or sparse-instance history"
description: "Add dry-run-first pm vcs gc. Reachability includes all refs, both sides of every oplog transition, active publication leases, resumable uploads and every shared instance index and pending merge. Apply uses the shared writer transaction and replans after interruption."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-13T12:06:42.555Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-13T16:31:33.202Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Dry run changes no payloads; --apply only deletes unreachable objects; oplog undo and active leases always retain their payloads; real processes race GC against push without losing objects; interrupted sweep can safely retry.
parent: pm-vcs-b7cb
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-13T12:06:58.106Z",codex-agent,"Audit: closed scale children implement fragments, range reads, sparse shared instances and typed authorized obliteration. Reachability already exists in bundle traversal and closure validation. No GC command or shallow/partial transfer exists. GC must also retain staged/conflict payloads and disconnected upload receipts, and refuse corrupt root metadata before deletion."
  "2026-10-13T12:22:34.561Z",codex-agent,"Implemented locked mark-and-sweep with strict root preflight, all ref namespaces, both oplog transition endpoints, detached HEAD, current and retired shared-instance indexes, pending merges, series and manifest descendants. Active receiver file leases conservatively retain all objects, including unattributed arrivals. Durable upload pins are recorded before writes; GC retires pins only after proving ref ownership. Dry run leaves objects untouched."
  "2026-10-13T12:35:43.744Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: removing only collectGarbage operation-log root collection makes the oplog-only displaced-history regression fail with three reachable-history addresses selected for deletion. Restoring the function restores the safety invariant. Active leases deliberately retain unattributed arrivals conservatively; abandoned receipt expiry is tracked separately."
  "2026-10-13T12:49:21.164Z",codex-agent,"Verification now includes real concurrent GC and full push in separate processes, GC between resumable upload and publication, SIGKILL during sweep with explicit dead-lock recovery, oplog-only undo, sparse/retired indexes, pending merge roots, active/released/expired leases and typed erasure audits. Revert proof is recorded. Final unchanged-threshold release gates are pending."
  "2026-10-13T13:00:52.088Z",codex-agent,"Current focused verification: node --test test/gc.test.ts test/partial-history.test.ts passes 26/26 with zero failures, skips, cancellations or todo. Tracker-linked GC execution passes 19/19. Test-only lint findings from the first committed head were corrected; lint now passes. Self-host is regenerated with each tracker/source commit. Full npm/Bun release gates remain pending."
  "2026-10-13T13:32:06.062Z",codex-agent,"Additional crash-boundary regression: GC must retain ancestors already present behind a stale shallow marker. Immutable fetch arrivals can precede the durable boundary refresh. The collector now walks held parents and omits only absent shallow parents. Reverting only that predicate makes the regression select six reachable ancestor objects for deletion. Restored implementation passes the combined focused suite 29/29."
  "2026-10-13T15:06:55.061Z",codex-agent,"Continuation review: verify the existing implementation and exact-head gates with the repo-pinned pm. Existing uncommitted paths are generated evidence artifacts; review committed source, repeat behavioral revert proofs, and regenerate self-host after final tracker receipts. No agents will be launched."
  "2026-10-13T15:12:10.635Z",codex-agent,"Continuation behavioral revert proofs repeated: removing only oplog root collection fails the displaced-history test; omitting held parents behind stale shallow metadata fails ancestor retention. Each mutation produces exactly one regression failure and is restored. No source artifacts or local paths will be published."
  "2026-10-13T15:13:26.753Z",codex-agent,"Restored implementation verification: repo-pinned pm test pm-vcs-phase6gc --run --progress passes all 19 linked tests, including real-process GC/push, upload/publication interruption and killed sweep recovery. Full strict tracker health passes after CI-equivalent extension installation; only pre-existing advisory warnings remain."
  "2026-10-13T15:47:31.094Z",codex-agent,"Implementation head 43dc17f passes the complete npm run release:check with isolated HOME and Git identity. All 1501 tests pass with zero failure, skip, cancellation or todo; all 61 production files measure 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines. Native TOON, stat cache, self-host equality, audit, pack, changelog and release-policy gates pass. CI Node 22/26 and both Windows launchers also pass. Greptile is unavailable after trial expiry; CodeRabbit requires manual review, so neither supplies approval. Upload abandonment remains the existing separate follow-up."
  "2026-10-13T16:30:53.125Z",pi-agent,"Continuation re-verification: discarding only the operation-log root collection from collectGarbage (validation retained) fails exactly the displaced-history regression with three reachable-history addresses selected for deletion; restoring it passes all 19 linked tests again through the repo-pinned pm."
  "2026-10-13T16:30:54.366Z",pi-agent,"Bun release gate completed at the implementation head: 1501/1501 tests pass with zero fail, skip, cancellation or todo and unchanged 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines; the full chain through self-host acceptance, changelog check and publish attestation succeeds. The npm gate receipt was recorded earlier; both gates now have complete results."
